# AdminPanelUI

## Stack

React 18, Vite, TypeScript (strict, no `any`), shadcn/ui, Tailwind, React Router v6, TanStack Query v5, React Hook Form + Zod, Axios, Lucide React.

## Structure

```
src/
├── pages/{domain}/          # {Name}Page.tsx, {Name}Table.tsx, {Name}Filters.tsx, dialogs/
├── components/shared/       # Only if used on 2+ pages
├── services/{name}Service.ts
├── hooks/use{Name}.ts
├── types/{name}.ts
├── lib/axios.ts, utils.ts, constants.ts
├── layouts/AdminLayout.tsx
└── router/index.tsx
```

## Rules

- One component per file; **max 150 lines** — split before exceeding
- No logic in JSX; no API calls in components; no server state in components
- Dialogs in `dialogs/` subfolder under the page folder
- All forms: RHF + Zod + shadcn `Form*` — mirror C# validation exactly
- Server state: React Query only (`useQuery` / `useMutation`); invalidate after mutations
- Loading: `Skeleton`; errors: `Alert` destructive
- Tables: shadcn `Table` + shared `DataTablePagination`
- Filter/search state on page component, passed as props
- JWT in `localStorage`; Axios interceptor; protected routes → `/login`
- shadcn/ui only; Tailwind utilities only; no inline `style={{}}`
- Responsive: Tailwind breakpoints; sidebar → `Sheet` on mobile; tables `overflow-x-auto`

## Naming

| Type | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Page folder | `PascalCase/` |
| Page entry | `{Name}Page.tsx` |
| Table | `{Name}Table.tsx` |
| Filters | `{Name}Filters.tsx` |
| Dialog | `{Action}{Name}Dialog.tsx` |
| Service | `{name}Service.ts` |
| Hook | `use{Name}.ts` |
| Types | `types/{name}.ts` |

## API Types (must match AdminAPI)

```typescript
interface ApiResponse<T> {
  success: boolean;
  message: string;
  data: T;
  errors: string[];
}

interface PagedResult<T> {
  items: T[];
  totalCount: number;
  pageNumber: number;
  pageSize: number;
  totalPages: number;
}
```
